    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, you've returned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Townsperson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for your contribution. I know how painful it must be for someone like you to go against your faith.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "text": "But providence lies just ahead. This is by no means a false promise, but true redemption.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lord Carmen is far beyond our comprehension. There's no point trying to deceive him. He will discover the truth before long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Townsperson"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should also thank Thiago. Our lie has condemned him to death at the hands of the Inquisition.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Townsperson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I have never seen the Herald of the Sea, but rumor has it, the Herald will not refuse the requests of its kin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because the choices of kin must surely benefit the entire kind, the thoughts of kin must also be shared by the entire kind. We ought to learn from this, as this is also a part of the Cycle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we'll let Thiago worry about himself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Townsperson"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Townsperson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, you still have doubts. They are unnecessary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our prophet, Miss Amaia. Will she really be able to come back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Townsperson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She has simply chosen to return to the sea one step ahead of us. She is to locate our path, our Herald, and the trails of the sleeping city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "text": "If she returns, it is to help her kin. If she does not, it is because she is making preparations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "text": "We needn't worry too much about her. Just know that she wishes to avoid the scrutiny of the Inquisition, regardless of where she might be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Then this person, this Iberian. Why did we abduct him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Townsperson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "His patroness seems to have made some kind of agreement with Carmen. He is an enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha... I really wish you'd choose another way of describing my relationship with the doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been investigating us, have you not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've devoted quite a lot of time explaining our ideals to you, and we would prefer not to hurt you. Have you thought things through?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think I've heard everything I need to know about your hypocrisy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hypocrisy? Ah, you still speak of morality, the morality of the human realm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I couldn't care less what these Sea Terrors or Seaborn really are. All I see are a bunch of outlaws inventing a reason to vent their frustrations with Iberia and the Inquisition.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "While I haven't lived here for a particularly long time, I AM an Iberian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I've been to a lot of places and seen a lot of different things. People like you who think they're special are actually a dime a dozen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the gods you talk about are real, and, uh, all that nonsense about being the pinnacle of evolution or the bleeding edge of life\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Then surely those gods must look down on people like you, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How dare you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Townsperson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No, he's right. That is why the Herald no longer speaks to us. That is why only Amaia can hear the voice of the ocean, and only she can guide us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(So there really was something off about Amaia. Tch, I should've caught on sooner.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(That said...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How's it looking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever those things of yours are, that nethersea brand, they aren't able to get into the center of town at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "text": "That black monster can do more than fly, it can even belch out terrifying jets of flame. The nethersea brand can't spread faster than it's being burned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "text": "If this gets dragged out, then Gran Faro will fall into the Inquisition's hands as soon as the Sea Terrors holding back the Penal Battalion are exterminated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we all die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Thiago, no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "text": "All these things you speak of... You do not grieve for the kin who willingly give themselves up to hold back our enemies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "text": "In other words, you are not yet resolved to sacrifice yourself for our entire kind at a moment's notice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't talk to me like that. Our interests happen to line up this time. I'm just an old fogey with no interest in becoming an ocean-hugger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...What a lowborn, stubborn creature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Same to you, friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you, lad, didn't I warn you not to meddle in other peoples' affairs?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thiago, you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know each other?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. He's just an outsider who kept hanging around the chapel. As the mayor, I need to have at least some idea of every person in town.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should've stayed out of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_450_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We should act soon, right? Or are we going to wait for the Inquisitor and his monster-wielding accomplice to burn my town to the ground?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will not. You seem awfully attached to this city. Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bizarre Cultist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gran Faro is the embodiment of our generation-spanning vision to rebuild our country, heretic. Ask any of the Iberians who've joined you, and you'll understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Inquisition has taken enough from us, and I intend to pay them back double.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Thiago"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
