    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am Skadi, not Ishar'mla.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You pronounce it differently, but what does it mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi knows, but dares not answer."
    },
    {
        "text": "Gladiia told her that she is alright, and she is willing to believe her."
    },
    {
        "text": "But that is only an escape. She knows what the name means."
    },
    {
        "text": "It means a thunderous roar within the abyss. Flesh and bone rubbing against the rock walls until only the Will remains, surging beyond the ocean."
    },
    {
        "text": "It means that after that harrowing battle, something was left in her body. 'Something.'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
