        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Inquisitor! How dare you join forces with them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "W-What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get off my ship this instant! Otherwise you'll join them in my hunt, as the quarry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Easy there, Mister Captain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now tell me, how did you... come to learn of this name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll tell you exactly how. We ate the flesh of these things and our bodies began to change. I personally executed three of the survivors, until only we remained.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now it's my turn to ask you\u2014their blood also flows in your veins. I can smell it. And you must be more special than the others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at my hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi looks down."
    },
    {
        "text": "One of the captain's arms has taken on the form of a Seaborn, its newly-formed webbing clearly visible, and its tentacle-like extensions ever squirming."
    },
    {
        "text": "He seems to be making an effort to restrain it. By the looks of it, whatever is inside that arm is also interfering with his body."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It thirsts for my mind. It tells me to liberate you, to talk to you, to listen to your thoughts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get off my ship before I kill the lot of you. Only by killing you can I maintain my sanity as a human\u2014begone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014We've paid an immense price just to get here. If you truly still are that Iberian hero, then you should join us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Think carefully, little Inquisitor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been in a bitter struggle for my life on this ship for longer than my homeland has been at war. What could you possibly understand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "text": "A single year of confinement can break a person's will. Do you have any idea how many years we've spent here, flirting with the waves?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seven or eight years ago, I personally executed the last crew member and threw him into the sea. He died as a human. He was the last to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were Iberia's best sailors, warriors, and scientists, stalwart in our faith. The most common way to die aboard this ship... was suicide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't imagine what I've been through. The left side of my body snatched away even my dreams. I no longer needed sleep. That itself was a form of torture.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And during this prolonged torture, I've had naught to do but hunt those monsters, large and small, and while away the remaining hours polishing my ship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave me and my chief mate be, and return to where you came from.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't belong to you, or to the sea. I belong only to my Iberia. To the Stultifera Navis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "27_g23_goldenboat_pass",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_footstep_stonestep",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Gladiia stops walking."
    },
    {
        "text": "While she contemplates why this place is so clean, she notices a change in the scent."
    },
    {
        "text": "Seaborn. Of course there are Seaborn here."
    },
    {
        "text": "But, what is the cause of this impure odor? And where did this vague premonition she is starting to feel come from?"
    },
    {
        "text": "She can only continue walking, following the path etched in the back of her mind, and attempt to reach the depths of the ship."
    },
    {
        "text": "Suddenly, she comes to a stop."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Don't you think you're being a bit too obtuse, appearing on this primitive transport vessel that hasn't docked in over sixty years?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bishop of the Deep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$plot_intro",
        "key": "$plot_loop",
        "fadetime": 3,
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw through me immediately. Do you suppose that means I chose the wrong place to appear?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You followed us here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hardly. Strictly speaking, I was the one who arrived first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ocean communicates with me. It accepts me. It aids me. From the very beginning, coming to this ship was a trivial task.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That you've been able to suppress your urge to rush forward and slay me is already quite impressive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it because you feel this ship is vital to your grand plans?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you after?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You killed Quintus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should've known better. So even you test-tube watching bottomfeeders\u2014pardon my language\u2014will pursue vengeance?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, you misunderstand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quintus was a bit too eager to attain results, and that temperament of his not only led to his demise, but also demonstrated conclusively that he was born human.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not that that's something to be ashamed of. Under our doctrine, we will never become what we seek to be by thought alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Only changes to nerve and sinew can be considered real.' Wouldn't you agree, Abyssal Hunter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't need to be enemies. I have no plans to do anything to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "One's end is decided at the moment of one's birth. Nothing can change this immutable fact.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You went through all the effort to follow us out to sea, just to spew this nonsense?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, about that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not something you need to know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_fish_howl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those lowly creatures won't be able to hold me back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$tactfulboost",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.2,
        "r": 0.3,
        "g": 0.3,
        "b": 5,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Amaia smiles sweetly but does not answer. A blue light emerges from under her feet, and it soon envelops the entire corridor."
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'nethersea brand.'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The nethersea brand at Gran Faro. So those traps were your handiwork.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hardly. You're all so quick to blame your every misfortune on the Church of the Deep, but never stop to consider the truth behind these phenomena.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "text": "These children have always existed in Gran Faro. I simply... found them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, cut the crap.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're out in the middle of the ocean. Our touch, invisible to the naked eye, is everywhere. This ship may not be of much use in your quest to return to \u00c6gir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, must you really insist on returning? Have you never had the slightest inclination to... listen to what the Heralds have to say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems you aren't too different from that stupid bishop after all. You've never even been in a real fight. Otherwise, you'd never say such an idiotic thing to a Hunter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. But not all Hunters take such pride in their arrogance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will meet again, Gladiia. You've disappointed me, but that's fine. Perhaps it's for the better that you have something to break out of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Meaning?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But whether you come or go, or whether \u00c6gir comes and goes, is not for me to decide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't be leaving this conversation alive though?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$b_char_mon3terdieroar_phase2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "(Earsplitting screech) \u2014!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quintus should've had a Herald by his side. You've fought with that Herald. You've spoken with that Herald.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "While you stagnate in place, the ocean is ever in motion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u00c6gir is far from smart enough to curb evolution itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amaia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_458_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gla-dia...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such weak, pitiful prey that cannot even speak. More like a beast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up and die. I still have a score to settle with that bishop. I need answers from her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
