    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "27_g22_goldenboat_hall",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "fadetime": 3,
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$b_char_mon3terdieroar_phase2",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Did you hear that, Chief Mate? Our quarry brays. It calls out to us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The monster known as the chief mate nods slightly, and uses its claws to straighten the crown that's started to slip from its head."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "It brays, it calls out to us\u2014 You brought yet more rabble with you?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#13$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It must be Swordfish...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "She must've discovered something. There's something unusual about the smell here, the sea breeze is confusing us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good thing these filthy \u00c6gir haven't scared it away. We've already been romping around for months, and I'd hate to see my ship even more beat up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Alfonso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "By hunt... Do you mean you're hunting the Seaborn?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1"
    },
    {
